# 5. Mission Statement

The mission of the Adaptive Vehicle Intelligence Architecture (AVIA) project is to research, design, develop, validate, and continuously improve an adaptive vehicle systems architecture through disciplined systems engineering.

The project achieves this mission by defining clear engineering objectives, establishing traceable system requirements, developing integrated engineering architectures, applying scientific and mathematical principles, validating proposed solutions through analysis and testing, and preserving engineering knowledge within a structured and governed repository.
